a. gusuzuma raporo zitangwa n’Urwego Nyobozi;
b. kwakira ibyifuzo no kubisuzuma bigishije
inama Urwego Nyobozi;
c. gusura mu gihe kizwi gihoraho ibihugu
byishingiwe ku matariki yumvikanweho
n’Urwego Nyobozi;
d. gufata ibi byemezo n’ibindi hakurikijwe
ibiteganyijwe n’amasezerano y’ubwishingire.
